---
profile: production
exclude_paths:
  - collections/
  - .github/
  - .cache/

skip_list:
  # Role variables here are deliberately NOT prefixed with the role name.
  # vars/zms-app.yml is the single source of truth for the demo application's
  # topology and is loaded by three playbooks that hand the same values to two
  # different roles (zms_app_db and zms_microservice). Prefixing would mean
  # duplicating every value per role, which defeats the point of one map. The
  # rest of var-naming (invalid characters, Python keywords, shadowed facts)
  # still applies -- only the role-prefix sub-rule is skipped.
  - var-naming[no-role-prefix]
